===== VCFMAIN after rebuild =====
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                AS/400 DEMO MENU                                |
| WELCOME TO...                                                                  |
|         V I N T A G E  C O M P U T E R  F E S T I V A L  2 0 2 4               |
| Start Here                              Exhibit Tasks                          |
|      1. Learn AS/400 Navigation              11. Nominate Exhibit for Award    |
|      2. IBM Midrange History                 12. Sign Exhibit Guestbook        |
|      3. About This System                    13. Read a Guestbook Comment      |
|      4. About Gertie the System/34      System Tasks                           |
| Office Tasks                                 80. Sign Off the System           |
|      5. Start OfficeVision/400          Administration                         |
|      6. Start a Calendar                     90. Start Admin Menu              |
|      7. Start the Clock                                                        |
| Entertainment                   Type the menu number you want and then         |
|      8. Play Snake              press the ENTER key which is located where     |
|     11. Play Yahtzee  asks      the right CTRL key normally is on a PC         |
|         Play PacMan             keyboard. Or type the menu option you are      |
|                                 curious about and press the HELP key.          |
|                                                                                |
| Type Number, then press ENTER                                                  |
| ===> GO ASHIBATA2/VCFMAIN                                                      |
|                                                                                |
| F3=Ex                    Retrieve   F12=Cancel   F13=Information Assistant     |
| F23=Set initial menu                                                           |
|                                                                                |
